.TH MCP-SERVER-SUBREG 1 "August 2026" "mcp-server-subreg" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcp-server-subreg \- MCP server exposing the Subreg.cz domain registrar API
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcp-server-subreg
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mcp-server-subreg
is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes the Subreg.cz
domain registrar SOAP API as tools for an LLM agent.
It communicates over stdio using the MCP protocol and is intended to be
launched by an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or any other
MCP-compatible agent runtime), not run interactively.
.PP
It is built on
.B fastmcp
and
.BR python3-subreg-client (7).
.SH TOOLS
.SS Read-only
.TP
.B check_domain(domain)
Check domain availability.
.TP
.B info_domain(domain)
Fetch registration details for a domain.
.TP
.B domains_list()
List domains held under the account.
.TP
.B pricelist()
Fetch the full TLD pricelist.
.TP
.B get_pricelist(pricelist)
Fetch a named pricelist.
.TP
.B get_credit()
Fetch the account credit balance.
.TP
.B info_user(user_id=None)
Fetch info about the authenticated or a specific sub-user.
.TP
.B get_dns_zone(domain)
Fetch DNS zone records for a domain.
.TP
.B info_contact(contact_id)
Fetch details for a contact object.
.TP
.B contacts_list()
List contact objects.
.TP
.B info_order(order_id)
Fetch the status of a submitted order.
.TP
.B get_tld_info(tld)
Fetch registration rules for a TLD.
.SS Mutating (require SUBREG_READONLY=false)
.TP
.B register_domain(domain, registrant_id, contacts_admin_id, contacts_tech_id, auth_id, ns_hosts=None, nsset=None, period=1)
Register a new domain.
.TP
.B renew_domain(domain, years=1)
Renew an existing domain.
.TP
.B delete_domain(domain)
Delete a domain registration.
.TP
.B add_dns_record(domain, name, type, content, ttl=None, prio=None)
Add a DNS record to a zone.
.TP
.B delete_dns_record(domain, record_id)
Delete a DNS record from a zone.
.TP
.B create_contact(params)
Create a new contact object.
.TP
.B update_contact(contact_id, params)
Update an existing contact object.
.TP
.B credit_correction(username, amount, reason)
Adjust a sub-user's credit balance.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B SUBREG_LOCATION
SOAP endpoint URL, e.g. https://soap.subreg.cz/cmd.php. Required.
.TP
.B SUBREG_URI
SOAP namespace URI, e.g. https://soap.subreg.cz/soap. Required.
.TP
.B SUBREG_LOGIN
Subreg account login. Required.
.TP
.B SUBREG_PASSWORD
Subreg account password. Required.
.TP
.B SUBREG_READONLY
When unset or true (the default), mutating tools raise instead of
executing. Set to false to allow domain/DNS/contact/billing writes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR python3-subreg-client (7)
.br
Project homepage: https://github.com/VitexSoftware/mcp-server-subreg
